            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This data set was generated to compare topic extraction solutions against each other without the availability of an authoritative  ground truth. The topics were extracted from a corpus of bibliographic data from the Web of Science of publications in 59 journals in Astrophysics and Astronomy published between 2003-2011. The comparative analysis was undertaken to obtain insights into how topic extraction approaches construct topics differently and how the resulting topical structures differ.</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
