            "typeName": "dataSources",
            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "Data was extracted from a corpus of bibliographic data indexed by the Web of Science of Thompson Reuters (now: Clarivate Analytics) of 111,616 papers in 59 journals in Astrophysics and Astronomy published between 2003-2011.\n\nThanks to Kevin Boyack (SciTech Strategies), all items in the corpus were indexed with thesaurus terms of the Unified Astronomy Thesaurus (UAT, http://astrothesaurus.org) pro bono by  Access Innovations, using their MAI (Machine Aided Indexer) software package and the UAT rule base that they maintain."
